Modules:
  IR Sensor
  Arduino Nano (or Uno)
  128x64 Oled Screen

Connection:
  IR Sensor + -> Arduino +5V
  IR Sensor - -> Arduino GND
  IR Sensor S -> Arduino pin 2

  Oled Screen VCC -> Arduino +5V
  Oled Screen GND -> Arduino GND
  Oled Screen SDA -> Arduino A4
  Oled Screen SCL -> Arduino A5

Library:
  IRemote
  OLED_I2C
